        <!-- Section: Perfect Squares -->
        <section class="article-section" id="section-perfect-squares">
            <div class="article-container">
                <div class="section-eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/></svg></span> Perfect Squares</div>
                <h2 class="article-h2">Perfect Squares — The Essential Memorization List</h2>
                <p>A perfect square is a number you get by multiplying a whole number by itself. Knowing these by heart makes square roots — and a lot of algebra — much faster.</p>
                <div class="table-scroll-wrapper">
                    <table class="data-table">
                        <thead><tr><th>Number</th><th>Square</th><th>Number</th><th>Square</th></tr></thead>
                        <tbody>
